      "id": "top-001",
      "userId": "usr-demo-001",
      "title": "Self-Balancing AVL Trees & Rotations",
      "subject": "Computer Science",
      "content": "# AVL Tree Properties & Invariants\n- **Height-balancing condition**: For every node, $|height(left) - height(right)| \\le 1$.\n- **Rotations**:\n  - LL: Single Right Rotation\n  - RR: Single Left Rotation\n  - LR: Left-Right Double Rotation\n  - RL: Right-Left Double Rotation\n- **Time Complexity**: Search, Insert, and Delete are guaranteed $O(\\log n)$.\n- **Rebalancing logic**: Check balance factor during bottom-up unwinding of insertion.",
      "tags": [
        "Data Structures",
        "Algorithms",
        "Trees"
      ],
      "initialStudyDate": "2026-10-13",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-13",
